          "findings": [
            {
              "message": "D1 embeds extensive workflow/implementation procedure (adr-editor/adr-diagnoser actions, rollback behavior, user-routing conditions, front-matter application, boundary stamps, and gate handling) instead of recording only the policy decision. This operational detail obscures the decision and belongs in the convention/workflow SSoT; delegate to those documents rather than prescribing it here.",
